  "notes": "Implements the fixture-first ML-Y-113 bridge at draft PR #2235. The app-local module validates renderer-neutral selections, injects governed resolution, enforces returned EvidenceRefs as a subset of clicked selection scope, and reuses the existing no-leak Evidence Drawer. Hosted validation exposed two test-only expectation defects: an import guard matched the word MapLibre in documentation, and one browser assertion expected bridge-local abstain text that the established drawer correctly replaced with fixed no-leak copy. Commits dc1f3841 and 4f049b26 repair those proofs without changing or weakening the runtime boundary. The slice adds no MapLibre dependency, network access, live API route, source activation, policy authority, release state, deployment, or publication."
